<title>EGYPT: Egypt says seeks 50,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Egypt says seeks 50,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state's main grain buyer said on Friday he wanted bids for 50,000 tonnes of U.S. soft red or soft wheat wheat by 09300 local/0630 GMT on Saturday. The wheat is for loading between October 15 and 31.</p>
<p>Samir Shakankiri, vice-chairman of the state's General Authority for Supply Commodities, told Reuters that the authority would announce the result of the tender by 1730/1430 on Sunday.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
